<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nouveau courrier à traiter - MINEPIA</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7fa;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header-logo {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .header-logo img {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            object-fit: contain;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            padding: 5px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .alert-box {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .alert-box p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #92400e;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .info-box h2 {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .info-item {
            display: flex;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dbeafe;
        }
        .info-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            min-width: 150px;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #374151;
            flex: 1;
        }
        .priority-high {
            background-color: #fee2e2;
            color: #991b1b;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .priority-normal {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #4b5563;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .link-box {
            background-color: #f0f9ff;
            border: 2px solid #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .link-box p {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .link-box a {
            color: #3b82f6;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .link-box a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .footer strong {
            color: #1e3a8a;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-logo">
                <img src="https://cdeno.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/LOGO-MINEPIA-1024x1024.jpg" alt="Logo MINEPIA">
            </div>
            <h1>📨 Nouveau Courrier à Traiter</h1>
            <p>Ministère de l'Élevage, des Pêches et des Industries Animales</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">
                Bonjour,
            </div>
            
            <div class="alert-box">
                <p>⚠️ Un nouveau courrier vous a été transmis pour traitement</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <h2>📋 Informations du courrier</h2>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Numéro :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.numero }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Référence :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.reference }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Objet :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.objet }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Expéditeur :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.civilite }} {{ courrier.nom }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Priorité :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">
                        <span class="priority-{{ courrier.priorite|lower == 'haute' ? 'high' : 'normal' }}">
                            {{ courrier.priorite }}
                        </span>
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Date d'arrivée :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.dateArrivee ? courrier.dateArrivee|date('d/m/Y') : 'N/A' }}</span>
                </div>
                {% if courrier.commentaire %}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Commentaire :</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ courrier.commentaire }}</span>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            
            <p class="message">
                ⏰ <strong>Veuillez traiter ce courrier dans les meilleurs délais.</strong><br>
                Vous pouvez accéder au système de gestion pour consulter le détail du courrier.
            </p>
            
            <div class="link-box">
                <p>🔗 Accédez au système de gestion :</p>
                <a href="https://minepia.cm/site/consultez-vos-dossiers/" target="_blank">
                    https://minepia.cm/site/consultez-vos-dossiers/
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            Cordialement,
            <strong>MINEPIA - Ministère de l'Élevage, des Pêches et des Industries Animales</strong>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
